{
 "id": "analytic_taylor_green_2d",
 "capability": "F3a",
 "title": "Decaying Taylor-Green vortex (translated, exact Dirichlet data): spatial orders of velocity AND pressure at T with the temporal error suppressed, kinetic energy",
 "physics": "u = (sin pi X cos pi Y, -cos pi X sin pi Y) F, p = (rho/4)(cos 2 pi X + cos 2 pi Y) F^2, X = x + 3/10, Y = y + 3/20, F = exp(-2 pi^2 nu t), nu = 1/20, on [0,1]^2, t in [0, 1/50]",
 "levels": [
  "analytic",
  "conservation"
 ],
 "run": {
  "runner": {
   "module": "f3a_transient",
   "function": "taylor_green",
   "check_module": "f3a_transient_check",
   "cost": "long",
   "timeout_s": 10800
  },
  "parameters": {
   "data": {
    "path": "tools/fluids_mms/out/f3a_tr_taylor_green.json",
    "sha256": "eff168953641378ce7c513e94d11fe172b880d9142b7f14294412c9b3124fcc3"
   },
   "element": {
    "velocity": "P2",
    "pressure": "P1",
    "geometry": "affine (straight-sided)"
   },
   "rho": 1.0,
   "mu": 0.05,
   "T": 0.02,
   "N_steps": 80,
   "dt": 0.00025,
   "dt_half_at_finest": 0.000125,
   "meshes": {
    "rect": {
     "family": "rect",
     "builder": "f3a_transient_check.rect_mesh",
     "nx": 4,
     "ny": 4,
     "box": [
      0,
      1,
      0,
      1
     ],
     "k": [
      0,
      1,
      2,
      3,
      4
     ],
     "h_nominal": [
      0.25,
      0.125,
      0.0625,
      0.03125,
      0.015625
     ],
     "construction": "4 x 4 squares of side 1/4 split along the (1,1) diagonal except the two corner cells, refined (red) k times; nested"
    }
   },
   "variants": [
    {
     "form": "lap",
     "scheme": "newton"
    },
    {
     "form": "sym",
     "scheme": "newton"
    },
    {
     "form": "sym",
     "scheme": "semi"
    }
   ],
   "order": 2,
   "time_scheme": {
    "bdf": "BDF of order k on the actual step sequence, omega_n = dt_n / dt_{n-1}: BDF1 (u^n - u^{n-1}) / dt_n; BDF2 [(1 + 2 w)/(1 + w) u^n - (1 + w) u^{n-1} + w^2/(1 + w) u^{n-2}] / dt_n (f3a_transient_check.bdf_coefficients); the momentum equation, the load f(t_n), Dirichlet data g(t_n) and traction data at t_n; p^n is the Lagrange multiplier of div u^n = 0 (no pressure time derivative, no pressure extrapolation)",
    "starter": "BDF2 starts with ONE BDF1 step of the same size from the initial state (fixed for the cross-code case X1; any starter with local error O(dt^2) passes the order items)",
    "newton": "Newton per step: the fully implicit BDF system (convection c(u^n; u^n, v)) solved by Newton to the fixed newton_rtol 1e-12 (dual norm, relative to the step's lifted residual)",
    "semi": "semi-implicit (linearly implicit): c(w; u^n, v) with the extrapolated advecting velocity w = u^{n-1} (BDF1) or w = (1 + omega_n) u^{n-1} - omega_n u^{n-2} (BDF2; f3a_transient_check.extrapolation_coefficients); one linear solve per step",
    "convection": "standard form c(w; u, v) = rho ((w. grad) u, v) (F2a; the skew form only if the F2a/F3a notes offer it: not proposed here)",
    "initial_data": "u_h(t_0) is DISCRETELY DIVERGENCE-FREE and takes the nodal Dirichlet data at t_0 (projection of the initial data); the L2 (Leray) projection is the reference choice, any projection that is discretely divergence-free and O(h^3)-accurate in L2 passes (mms_ns_transient_initial)",
    "dirichlet_data": "P2 Lagrange NODAL interpolation of the fixed callables at t_n (vertices and edge midpoints); at an axis node u_r = u_theta = 0 beats the data (F2a shared-node rule)",
    "quadrature_requirement": "As F2a: the convective trilinear form, the mass form and every load integral are integrated EXACTLY for the polynomial integrands of P2 on affine triangles (degree >= 5 planar, >= 6 axisymmetric); the r-weighted viscous form in axisymmetry by a rule of degree >= 6. The mass matrix is the CONSISTENT one. The space-exact temporal MMS, the energy identities and the cross-code values assume it."
   },
   "newton_rtol": 1e-12,
   "boundaries": "exact Dirichlet data at t_n on all four edges (u.n of both signs; translated vortex)",
   "kinetic_energy": "E_h(T) = rho/2 ||u_h(T)||^2 vs rho/4 exp(-4 pi^2 nu T) (full periods: translation invariant)"
  }
 },
